## Customize flags given to the VM: http://erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Railway exposes every host CPU (48) to the container, so by default the VM
## starts 48 schedulers + 48 dirty CPU schedulers, each with its own memory
## allocators. A single-instance bot is I/O bound; two of each is plenty.
+S 2:2
+SDcpu 2:2
+SDio 4

## Don't busy-wait idle schedulers: CPU is billed per use.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

-start_epmd false -erl_epmd_port 6789
